这是Unity中一个简单音频可视化器脚本的示例：
```csharp
using UnityEngine;
using UnityEngine.UI;
public class AudioVisualizer : MonoBehaviour
{
    public AudioSource audioSource;
    public RectTransform visualizer;
    private float[] samples = new float[64];
    void Update()
    {
        audioSource.GetSpectrumData(samples, 0, FFTWindow.BlackmanHarris);
        float maxSample = 0f;
        foreach (float sample in samples)
        {
            if (sample > maxSample)
            {
                maxSample = sample;
            }
        }
        visualizer.localScale = new Vector3(visualizer.localScale.x, maxSample * 100f, visualizer.localScale.z);
    }
}
```
该脚本假设您的游戏对象上附加了`AudioSource`组件和可视化器的`RectTransform`组件。使用`GetSpectrumData`方法从音频剪辑中获取音频样本，使用`foreach`循环查找最大样本值。然后将可视化器的`localScale`设置为与最大样本成比例的高度。

